# ContractCreated

## Purpose

Represents the creation of a new Player Contract.

This establishes the initial financial obligation.

---

### Trigger

CreateContract Command succeeds.

---

### Payload

```json
{
  "contract_id": "uuid",
  "player_id": "uuid",
  "franchise_id": "uuid",
  "salary": 28,
  "years_remaining": 4,
  "season": 2027
}
```

---

### Business Impact

• Creates financial obligation

• Reduces cap space

• Establishes years remaining

• Enables future extensions

• Enables restructures

• Enables dead cap calculations

• Invalidates cap projections

• Invalidates roster value calculations

---

### AI Interpretation

The AI now knows:

- current salary
- contract length
- future obligation
- future free agency date

---

# ContractSalaryChanged

## Purpose

Represents a modification to annual salary without replacing the Contract.

---

### Business Impact

• Changes annual cap hit

• Changes future cap projections

• Alters affordability

• Alters financial flexibility

• Invalidates salary calculations

• Invalidates cap calculations

---

# ContractExtended

## Purpose

Adds additional years to an existing Contract.

---

### Business Impact

• Increases years remaining

• Delays free agency

• Changes future cap obligations

• Alters roster stability

• Alters competitive window

• AI recalculates long-term planning

---

# ContractRestructured

## Purpose

Represents redistribution of financial obligations while preserving the Contract.

---

### Business Impact

• Salary distribution changes

• Future obligations change

• Dead cap projections change

• Current cap flexibility changes

• Long-term flexibility changes

---

# ContractYearReduced

## Purpose

Occurs automatically during annual rollover.

---

### Trigger

SeasonRolloverCompleted

---

### Business Impact

• Years remaining decreases

• Future FA approaches

• Future obligation shortens

• AI recalculates timelines

---

# ContractExpired

## Purpose

Represents the natural completion of a Contract.

---

### Business Impact

• Financial obligation ends

• Player eligible for Free Agency

• Cap space increases

• Future obligation removed

• Invalidates FA projections

---

# ContractTerminated

## Purpose

Represents termination before expiration.

---

### Business Impact

• Contract ends immediately

• Dead Cap created

• Player removed

• Cap recalculated

• Future obligation recalculated

---

# DeadCapObligationCreated

## Purpose

Represents creation of remaining financial liability after termination.

---

### Business Impact

• Creates dead cap

• Reduces available cap

• Persists across seasons

• Changes financial flexibility

• Invalidates cap projections

---

# DeadCapObligationReduced

## Purpose

Represents annual reduction of dead cap.

---

### Business Impact

• Increases cap flexibility

• Reduces obligation

• Improves financial outlook

---

# DeadCapObligationSatisfied

## Purpose

Represents complete elimination of dead cap.

---

### Business Impact

• Removes financial liability

• Fully restores cap flexibility

• Removes future obligation

---

# TeamOptionCreated

## Purpose

Creates optional future Contract decision.

---

### Business Impact

• Creates conditional obligation

• Delays FA certainty

• Adds strategic flexibility

• AI evaluates option value

---

# TeamOptionExercised

## Purpose

Team elects to execute option.

---

### Business Impact

• Extends Contract

• Creates future salary

• Alters cap

• Delays free agency

---

# TeamOptionDeclined

## Purpose

Team elects not to execute option.

---

### Business Impact

• Player remains on existing deal

• Future FA unchanged

• Removes optional pathway

---

# TeamOptionExpired

## Purpose

Represents unused option reaching expiration.

---

### Business Impact

• Removes optional extension

• Player follows existing Contract

• AI removes future branch

